WEBVTT

00:00:07.264 --> 00:00:08.570
[INDISTINCT CHATTERING]

00:00:11.442 --> 00:00:13.532
Now let's prepare
the main course.

00:00:15.011 --> 00:00:16.143
The Trolls!

00:00:16.186 --> 00:00:17.274
[TROLLS SCREAMING]

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.278
[LAUGHING]

00:00:26.632 --> 00:00:29.591
[GASPS] Poppy?

00:00:29.635 --> 00:00:33.595
Poppy! Oh, thank goodness
you're all right.

00:00:33.639 --> 00:00:35.597
I'm doing great.

00:00:35.641 --> 00:00:37.425
I got everybody
I love thrown in a pot.

00:00:37.468 --> 00:00:38.992
Thanks for asking.

00:00:41.516 --> 00:00:43.953
Poppy? Are you being...

00:00:44.954 --> 00:00:46.608
sarcastic?

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.175
Yes!

00:00:48.218 --> 00:00:49.306
[ALL GASPING]

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:50.351
Oh, my God!

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:52.614
I'm sorry.

00:00:52.658 --> 00:00:54.790
I don't know why
I thought I could save you.

00:00:57.663 --> 00:00:59.926
All I wanted to do
was keep everyone safe,

00:00:59.969 --> 00:01:01.797
like you did, Dad.

00:01:01.841 --> 00:01:03.494
But I couldn't.

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:05.366
Poppy.

00:01:07.673 --> 00:01:10.023
I let everyone down.

00:01:13.983 --> 00:01:16.551
[SIGHS] But, Poppy...

00:01:16.595 --> 00:01:18.988
You were right, Branch.

00:01:19.032 --> 00:01:21.861
The world isn't all
cupcakes and rainbows.

00:01:34.264 --> 00:01:35.526
[SOFTLY] Poppy.

00:02:25.881 --> 00:02:27.230
[SIGHS]

00:03:11.797 --> 00:03:15.452
BRANCH:
♪ You with the sad eyes

00:03:24.548 --> 00:03:27.943
♪ Don't be discouraged

00:03:45.482 --> 00:03:48.137
♪ Oh, I realize

00:03:49.486 --> 00:03:52.228
♪ It's hard to take courage

00:03:53.142 --> 00:03:56.450
♪ In a world full of people

00:03:56.493 --> 00:03:59.714
♪ You can lose
sight of it all

00:03:59.758 --> 00:04:02.108
♪ The darkness inside you

00:04:02.151 --> 00:04:05.720
♪ Can make you feel so small

00:04:06.547 --> 00:04:07.896
[CHIMES]

00:04:17.253 --> 00:04:19.690
[FLOWERS CHIMING]

00:04:31.615 --> 00:04:33.661
What are you doing?
The king is waiting.

00:04:33.704 --> 00:04:34.836
Get those Trolls out there!

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:36.011
Sorry, Chef.

00:04:36.055 --> 00:04:37.404
Oh, you are sorry.

00:04:44.933 --> 00:04:49.677
♪ Show me a smile then

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:54.595
♪ Don't be unhappy,
can't remember when

00:04:56.423 --> 00:04:59.513
♪ I last saw you laughing

00:04:59.556 --> 00:05:02.908
♪ This world makes you crazy

00:05:02.951 --> 00:05:06.215
♪ And you've taken
all you can bear

00:05:06.259 --> 00:05:09.001
♪ Just call me up

00:05:09.044 --> 00:05:12.178
♪ 'Cause I will
always be there

00:05:12.221 --> 00:05:16.356
♪ And I see your true colors

00:05:16.399 --> 00:05:19.185
♪ Shining through

00:05:19.228 --> 00:05:23.450
♪ I see your true colors

00:05:23.493 --> 00:05:27.758
♪ And that's why I love you

00:05:31.588 --> 00:05:34.896
♪ So don't be afraid

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:37.899
♪ To let them show

00:05:37.943 --> 00:05:41.598
♪ Your true colors

00:05:41.642 --> 00:05:46.690
♪ True colors are beautiful

00:05:50.433 --> 00:05:54.220
♪ I see your true colors

00:05:54.263 --> 00:05:56.613
♪ Shining through ♪ True colors

00:05:56.657 --> 00:06:01.053
♪ I see your true colors

00:06:01.096 --> 00:06:04.099
♪ That's why I love you

00:06:04.143 --> 00:06:06.928
♪ So don't be afraid

00:06:06.972 --> 00:06:10.279
♪ To let them show

00:06:10.323 --> 00:06:13.935
♪ Your true colors

00:06:13.979 --> 00:06:16.938
♪ True colors[SQUEAKS]

00:06:16.982 --> 00:06:21.638
♪ Are beautiful

00:06:22.988 --> 00:06:27.253
♪ Like a rainbow

00:06:27.296 --> 00:06:29.864
♪ Oh, oh, oh...

00:06:29.908 --> 00:06:33.912
♪ Like a rainbow

